OL,3,GNEWSADaniel Thomas jailed for 15 months
OL,4,Afor slashing dinghy
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnti-migrant activist Daniel Thomas,
OL,7,Falso known as Danny Tommo, has been
OL,8,Fjailed for 15 months for criminal
OL,9,Fdamage
OL,11,FEarlier this month he admitted slashing
OL,12,Fa dinghy with a knife in the English
OL,13,FChannel in September
OL,15,FHe had been livestreaming on a boat
OL,16,Fwhile he observed the migrant occupants
OL,17,Fof the dinghy being taken off by the
OL,18,FRNLI, Border Force and the French
OL,19,FCoastguard
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,336,330,200,160,0,100
