OL,3,GNEWSADaniel Thomas jailed for 15 months
OL,4,Afor slashing dinghy
OL,5,
OL,6,FThomas then used a knife to slash holes
OL,7,Fin the dinghy, which had French
OL,8,Fpersonnel on board
OL,10,FHe could be heard saying: "This is what
OL,11,Fneeds to happen to everyone in these
OL,12,Fboats"
